QuestGuidance.Register("en",189,{
[6017]="70061773\n1\tDefeat half-orcs at Taerhad (total: 10)\tHalf-orcs can be found at Taerhad in Yondershire. While exploring the Yondershire, you have encountered a company of hostile half-orcs at Taerhad. You should defeat half-orcs at Taerhad.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many half-orcs at Taerhad.\n",
[6018]="70040FD4\n1\tCollect mugs of ale for Nasar (total: 3)\tMugs of ale can be found by the fountains in central Ost Lontir. Othor has asked you to retrieve the mugs of ale he and his friends were sharing earlier.\n2\tBring the mugs of ale to Nasar\tNasar can be found outside the west gate of Ost Lontir. You have gathered a substantial amount of ale, and should now present it to Nasar.\n3\tTalk to Othor\tOthor can be found just outside the west gate of Ost Lontir. You have provided Nasar with ale, but he still seems to want more. You should talk to Othor.\n4\tCollect a barrel of ale for Othor\tA barrel of ale can be found near one of the shops in Ost Lontir. Othor has asked you to retrieve a barrel of ale he purchased for his men in hopes that it will be enough to keep Nasar talking.\n5\tDeliver the barrel of ale to Othor\tOthor can be found just outside the west gate of Ost Lontir. You have retrieved the barrel of ale for Nasar. You should talk to Othor.\n",
[6019]="70008361\n1\tBring the turtle meat and shell plates to Othran\030Collect turtle-meat (total: 2)\030Collect turtle shell-plates (total: 2)\tThe turtles live throughout the western reaches of Malenhad. Othran is at Tyrn Lhug, in the south-west corner of Malenhad. Othran has offered to pay you for the meat and shell plates of the giant turtles of Malenhad.\n",
[6020]="70046C46\n1\tListen to Mablung's tale\tMablung can be found in Henneth Annûn. Mablung has offered to tell you what he remembers of the Halflings and their time in Ithilien.\n2\tTalk to Mablung in Henneth Annûn\tMablung can be found in Henneth Annûn. Mablung has finished his tale, and you should now ask if he knows more of the Halflings.\n",
[6021]="70020DA9\n1\tFind the Hobbits of Enedwaith\tHobbits apparently dwell somewhere in the Gloomglens. Idhrenfair suggested you seek the hobbits in the west, as that is the likely direction the first hobbits would have taken on their journey into Eriador.\n",
[6022]="70019211\n1\tSearch Lumul-nar for information\tLumul-nar is in Zirakzigil, north and slightly east of the Chamber of the Cross-roads. Hrólfur, at the bidding of the Elves, has asked you to investigate Lumul-nar to discover why the light-sources no longer throw their beams through the dark halls of Khazad-dûm.\n2\tTalk to Hrólfur at the Chamber of the Cross-roads\tHrólfur stands at the Chamber of the Cross-roads, south and slightly west of Lumul-nar in Moria. You should bring the ancient records of the mirrors to Hrólfur, along with the news that you have been able to restore them to their former state.\n",
[6023]="700032A9\n1\tDefeat foul creatures in Tham Gelair (total: 6)\tTham Gelair lies to the west of Celondim. Thinglaer has asked you to go to the ruins of Tham Gelair and slay some of the foul creatures there.\n2\tPlace Thinglaer's token upon the stone table\tTham Gelair is west of Celondim. Thinglaer has asked you to place his token within the Elf-ruins west of Celondim.\n3\tTalk to Thinglaer\tThinglaer is at Celondim, east of Tham Gelair. You should return to Thinglaer and let him know that you have done as he asked.\n",
[6024]="7005559D\n1\tCollect Gondorian scrolls (total: 8)\tGondorian scrolls can be found in Ghashan-kútot, the Halls of Black Lore. You should collect Gondorian scrolls.\n2\tReturn to Ereblen\tEreblen can be found at Echad Uial. You should bring the Gondorian scrolls to Ereblen.\n",
[6025]="700555A2\n1\tDestroy Morgul manuscripts (total: 8)\tMorgul manuscripts can be found in Ghashan-kútot, the Halls of Black Lore. You should destroy the Morgul manuscripts.\n2\tCompleted\tDestroyed Morgul manuscripts within Ghashan-kútot.\n",
[6026]="70019612\n1\tDefeat Thaguzg\tThaguzg can be found deep within the Halls of Crafting, in the southern reaches of Moria's Flaming Deeps. Baranglim has asked you to defeat Thaguzg when you venture into the Halls of Crafting. Without his leadership, the Orcs will surely despair of their plot.\n2\tTalk to Baranglim\tBaranglim can be found outside the Halls of Crafting in the Flaming Deeps. You should hasten to Baranglim to inform him of Thaguzg's defeat.\n",
[6027]="700195A5\n1\tTalk to Baranglim\tBaranglim can be found in the Flaming Deeps of Moria, near the Halls of Crafting. You should go to Baranglim and speak with him about what must be done to weaken the Orc-forces rallying to assault Lothlórien.\n2\tPlace the Elf-stone in the Halls of Crafting\tThe Halls of Crafting is in the southern reaches of the Flaming Deeps of Moria, near Fil Gashan. Baranglim has given you an Elf-stone to place in the Halls of Crafting. If you drive out the enemies and place the stone there, the Orcs will fear to return again.\n3\tTalk to Haldir\tHaldir is upon his talan on the banks of the Nimrodel, in Lothlórien. You should speak with Haldir and tell him all that you saw and achieved in the Halls of Crafting.\n",
[6028]="70019613\n1\tDefeat Bashkuga\030Defeat Âmbal\tÂmbal and Bashkuga can surely be found in the Halls of Crafting in Moria, found in the southern reaches of the Flaming Deeps near Fil Gashan. Baranglim has asked you to defeat Âmbal and Bashkuga, the expert Orc-artisans in the Halls of Crafting, for they cannot be allowed to produce more weapons of war to be used against dwarves and Elves alike.\n2\tTalk to Baranglim\tBaranglim stands outside the entrance to the Halls of Crafting, in the Flaming Deeps. You should speak with Baranglim and inform him of your success against the masterminds of the Halls of Crafting.\n",
[6029]="70019614\n1\tDestroy the foul draught of the Enemy\tThe Halls of Crafting are in the southern reaches of the Flaming Deeps in Moria, near Fil Gashan. Gornellon, a wary Galadhrim scout, wishes you to destroy the draught being made to lend strength to the Orc forces planning an assault against Lórien.\n2\tTalk to Gornellon\tGornellon is outside the Halls of Crafting, in the Flaming Deeps. You should speak with Gornellon and inform him of your success against the Orc-draughts being brewed in the Halls of Crafting.\n",
[6030]="70019615\n1\tCollect unspoiled armour (total: 12)\030Collect unspoiled weapons (total: 12)\tThe Halls of Crafting are in the southern reaches of Moria's Flaming Deeps, near Fil Gashan. Gornellon has asked you to salvage weapons and armour that have not been spoiled by the Orcs and goblins, for they will be better used by the people that made them.\n2\tBring the weapons and armour to Gornellon\tGornellon is outside the Halls of Crafting, in the Flaming Deeps. You should bring all that you collected to Gornellon, and he will see that the good dwarves of Khazad-dûm will receive this boon.\n",
[6031]="70025B7D\n1\tTalk to Orchalwë at Tinnudir\tOrchalwë is at Tinnudir, west of Torogethir's camp. Orchalwë will be pleased to hear that the problems at Ost Heryn have been resolved.\n",
[6032]="70020997\n1\tTalk to Lotho Sackville-Baggins at The Plough and Stars\tLotho Sackville-Baggins is visiting Brockenborings and can be found inside the inn there. Halros has decided to travel south with the Grey Company and wants you to tell his friend Lotho of his decision.\n2\tTalk to Halros in the Greenfields\tThe Ranger Halros is at his camp in the Greenfields, in the north-east corner of the Shire. You have delivered Halros's message to Lotho and should return now to the Ranger.\n",
[6033]="70020998\n1\tTalk to Lotho Sackville-Baggins at The Plough and Stars\tLotho Sackville-Baggins is visiting Brockenborings and can be found inside the inn there. Halros has decided to stay in the Shire to keep watch over its people and wants you to tell his friend Lotho of his decision.\n2\tTalk to Halros in the Greenfields\tThe Ranger Halros is at his camp in the Greenfields, in the north-east corner of the Shire. You have delivered Halros' message to Lotho and should return now to the Ranger.\n",
[6034]="7004D525\n1\tEnter Urûshoba\tSiege engines and banners can be found in the encampment of Urûshoba. You should destroy siege engines and banners.\n2\tDestroy Jangovar banners (total: 12)\030Destroy siege engines (total: 8)\tSiege engines and banners can be found in the encampment of Urûshoba. You should destroy siege engines and banners.\n3\tCompleted\tDestroyed many siege engines and banners.\n",
[6035]="70016707\n1\tDefeat Orcs (total: 15)\tOrcs can be found at Uruk-gashan, Drû-garmadh, and Athmadhul, all south-east of Mekhem-bizru. Raskwith asked you to head into the Dimrill Dale and thin the ranks of the Orcs there.\n2\tTalk to Raskwith at Mekhem-bizru\tRaskwith is at Mekhem-bizru, north-west of the Orc-camps. Raskwith will be pleased to hear that the ranks of the Orcs have been thinned.\n",
[6036]="7004A822\n1\tDefeat Mordor Pullers in Dâr Mauzur (total: 6)\030Destroy tools in Dâr Mauzur (total: 8)\030Destroy waggons in Dâr Mauzur (total: 6)\tBregdal has asked you to defeat Mordor Pullers in Dâr Mauzur and destroy tools and waggons.\n",
[6037]="700440E3\n1\tTalk to Mithrandir when you are ready\tMithrandir is on the wall atop the Great Gate. You should talk to Mithrandir when you are ready to defend Minas Tirith.\n2\tDefend the northern flank of the gate-wall\tThe battle has begun on the northern flank. You should aid the defenders there and destroy the siege engines of the Enemy.\n3\tDefend the southern flank of the gate-wall\tThe battle has shifted to the southern flank. You should aid the defenders there and destroy the siege engines of the Enemy.\n4\tDefend the Great Gate\tThe battle has moved to the Great Gate. You should defend it and work to repel Grond before it can reach the gates.\n5\tCheck this stage in the quest journal.\t\n",
[6038]="700442D6\n1\tTalk to Mithrandir when you are ready\tMithrandir is on the wall atop the Great Gate. You should talk to Mithrandir when you are ready to defend Minas Tirith.\n2\tDefend the northern flank of the gate-wall\tThe battle has begun on the northern flank. You should aid the defenders there and destroy the siege engines of the Enemy.\n3\tDefend the southern flank of the gate-wall\tThe battle has shifted to the southern flank. You should aid the defenders there and destroy the siege engines of the Enemy.\n4\tDefend the Great Gate\tThe battle has moved to the Great Gate. You should defend it and work to repel Grond before it can reach the gates.\n5\tCheck this stage in the quest journal.\t\n",
[6039]="7006EEE9\n1\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Dun Shûma when you are ready\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Dun Shûma when you are ready.\n2\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Dun Shûma\tSpeak with Mizâdi in Dun Shûma.\n",
[6040]="70000C32\n1\tTalk to Hana the Young\tHana can be found within Ost Guruth, near the tower at the end of the main avenue. Frideric the Elder informed you that Hana the Young took an object from the swamp and that her dreams since that time fill her with terror. He asked that you speak with the girl to discover what her nightmares entail.\n",
[6041]="70040FBE\n1\tConfront and defeat Dolguzîr\tDolguzîr can be found somewhere on the north-most ship at Edhellond. Dolvir has asked you to defeat Dolguzîr in hopes that it will shatter the leadership in Edhellond.\n2\tTalk to Dolvir\tDolvir can be found on a hilltop to the east of Edhellond. You have defeated the Corsair captain, Dolguzîr, and broken the leadership of the Corsairs in Edhellond.\n3\tTalk to Gilanor\tGilanor can be found in Ost Lontir in central Belfalas. You have slain the Corsair leader in Edhellond and aided Dolvir. You should now return to Gilanor.\n",
[6042]="70044E44\n1\tDeliver invitations to Myrtle Boggs, Merrimac Fairbairn, and Poppy Bracegirdle\030Deliver invitation to Prisca Boffin\030Deliver invitation to Milo Goodbody\030Deliver invitations to Haley and Theodore\030Deliver invitation to Bilbo Baggins\030Deliver invitation to Spalvi Stout-heart\030Deliver invitation to Langhár\030Deliver invitation to Egwylf\030Deliver invitation to Humfrey Rumming\030Deliver invitation to Iola Isbrun\030Deliver invitation to Willem Whisker\030Leave any invitations you do not deliver on Postmaster Proudfoot's table\tBingo would like for you to deliver the invitations for his dinner party, if you have the patience to do so. He asked that you leave any invitations you do not deliver on the table near Postmaster Proudfoot by the Town Hole in Michel Delving. Bert Bartleby should know where you need to bring the invitations.\n2\tTalk to Bingo inside his hobbit-hole in Michel Delving\tNow that the invites are out of your hands, it is time for Bingo to prepare for the party!\n3\tTalk to Bingo inside his hobbit-hole in Michel Delving\tBingo is inside his hobbit-hole in Michel Delving, north of the Town Hole.\n",
[6043]="7001A4A4\n1\tDefeat Taughâsh Warg-keepers in Maudhul-ulur (total: 5)\tGoblin Warg-keepers can be found at Maudhul-ulur, south from Echad Glamodúd. Goldínwen has asked you to defeat the goblin Warg-keepers in order to throw the kennel into disarray.\n2\tTalk to Goldínwen at Echad Glamodúd\tGoldínwen is at Echad Glamodúd, north from Maudhul-ulur. You should return to Goldínwen and report your success.\n",
[6044]="70020AA5\n1\tBring the fake swill to Nathalan in Angmar\030Bring the fake Limael's Vintage to Wesley Hopwood in Bree-land\030Bring the fake Forsaken Ale to Alrek in Ered Luin\030Bring the fake Dorwinion White to Lendasil in Ered Luin\030Bring the fake Blagrove's Brown to Harigar Mudbottom in Evendim\030Bring the fake Moor-boar Beer to Lófi\tNathalan can be found in Angmar. Wesley Hopwood is in Bree-land. Alrek is in Ered Luin. Lendasil may be found in Ered Luin. Harigar Mudbottom is in Evendim. Lófi is in Forochel. The spiteful dwarf Jónar has asked you to deliver fake versions of the Inn League members' requests all over Middle-earth.\n",
[6045]="7001E989\n1\tDefeat Hîshtgropor Marauders (total: 8)\030Defeat Hîshtgropor Bloodbows (total: 8)\tÂnghum-maudhûl lies to the south-east of Mithechad. Harchador has asked you to harass the Orcs assigned to the encampment of Ânghum-maudhûl.\n2\tTalk to Harchador at Mithechad\tHarchador is at Mithechad, located on the western border of the Ashenslades, south-west of Ânghum-maudhûl. After harassing the patrols outside of Ânghum-maudhûl, you should return to speak with Harchador.\n",
[6046]="7003EB01\n1\tDefeat crawlers in the Bruinen Gorges (total: 6)\tThere are crawlers infesting the Bruinen Gorges of the Trollshaws. While you are in the Bruinen Gorges, you should cull the number of crawlers, hopefully reducing the risk of disease.\n",
[6047]="70072BF8\n1\tExamine the pods of blight in Adagím\tPods of the blight draw your attention in the woods of Adagím.\n2\tDefeat zizani in Adagím (total: 6)\tThough they are not known as neekerbreekers in these lands, the zizani of Adagím are no less obtrusive and harmful to the crops and people found here.\n3\tCompleted\tThe song of the zizani has been quieted for a time.\n",
[6048]="700385FC\n1\tTalk to Thane Edric\tThane Edric can be found inside the Mead Hall of Entwade. Thane Edric has asked you to accompany him to Edoras to meet with Éowyn. You should speak to him when you are ready.\n2\tTalk to Éowyn outside Meduseld\tÉowyn can be found outside Meduseld in Edoras. You have incapacitated Edric, sparing the people of Edoras his rage. You should now speak with Éowyn.\n",
})
